<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

`front.ts` holds the verb socket for the floor: serves the claim once, parks callers between compositions, answers the holder probe. The front outlives every composition; a seat attaches and detaches beneath it. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/uds-channel-dam`>>) carries its observations.

